      "status": "proposed-substitute",
      "modeljarsCatalogId": null,
      "notes": "The official Qwen GGUF repository publishes no Q4_K_M file for this size (only Q8_0), so this is a proposed substitute, not a pin the protocol names. Unsloth quantizations may be produced with an importance matrix (imatrix), unlike the official Qwen files, which would confound H6 (quantization tolerance) with quantizer differences. Alternative: quantize the official Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B safetensors with a pinned llama.cpp convert_hf_to_gguf.py + llama-quantize Q4_K_M without imatrix, and pin the result. Requires explicit approval (host-run refuses it unless ALLOW_PROPOSED_PINS=1). Observed: this file (396.7 MB) is markedly smaller than other publishers' 0.6B Q4_K_M files (bartowski 484.2 MB, lmstudio-community 484.2 MB), so its tensor-type mix differs from a stock Q4_K_M."
    },
